  "source_brief": {
    "silhouette": "A wide arch formed by two high shoulder guards and a tall rectangular shield with a rounded top. The lower body remains a stable trapezoid.",
    "face": "Deep moss-green skin, warm brown eyes, small tusks and tightly braided dark hair. Her expression is attentive rather than aggressive.",
    "costume": "Layered leather-and-bronze armor, a pale ochre shoulder wrap, a blue woven sash and thick boots. Broad woven patterns identify her caravan community.",
    "palette": "Bronze #AC8658; ochre #D1B576; deep blue #405E78; moss #60765A.",
    "equipment": "A broad fantasy tower shield and a short ceremonial mace. The shield carries a simple interlocking-road emblem with no dense carving.",
    "signature": "Rounded tower shield, arched shoulders and a bold blue waist sash.",
    "materials": "Worn bronze, thick cloth and matte hide. Shield wear is painted as soft color variation rather than deep damage.",
    "back": "A flat travel pack sits beneath the shoulder line. Keep its volume low enough not to collide with the shield when turning.",
    "animation": "Idle angles the shield protectively toward adjacent allies. Basics use a short mace arc. Shared Guard plants the shield and extends the free hand outward, clearly signaling a group effect.",
    "vfx": "Several short amber shield outlines appear on eligible recipients; a brief ground ring shows reach. No continuous aura follows her afterward.",
    "audio": "One low shield chime and quiet recipient ticks, mixed as a single event rather than many full-volume sounds.",
    "risk": "Large shield and shoulders may occlude neighboring supports. Use a lowered idle pose and test the camera from both encounter orientations."
  },
